=> t_gen FLIPS its verdict across repeats of identical, seeded code.
   The structures are the same every time; only the clock moved. A
   wall-clock 'complexity' signal is therefore not a property of the
   chemistry, and cannot support a claim about lignin.
=> The event count, by contrast, is stable: identical counts and the
   same verdict every repeat -- it measures the algorithm, not the host.
